Package: OmaDB
Title: R wrapper for the OMA REST API
Version: 2.29.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Klara", "Kaleb", role = "aut"),
    person("Adrian", "Altenhoff", 
        email = "adrian.altenhoff@inf.ethz.ch",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7492-1273")))
Description: A package for the orthology prediction data download from the
    OMA browser database (https://omabrowser.org). It provides access to
    proteins, genomes, Hierarchical Orthologous Groups (HOGs), OMA Groups,
    pairwise orthologs, the taxonomy and (ancestral) synteny via the OMA
    REST API. The results are returned as data.frames or objects using
    standard Bioconductor classes such as GRanges and AAString, and can be
    used for downstream analyses, e.g. Gene Ontology enrichment with topGO.
    Responses are cached in memory and optionally on disk.
Depends: R (>= 4.6.0)
